    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Legal disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_intro">CRIM-SYS 2026 is an organizational aid for legal work. It does not provide legal advice and does not replace the responsible attorney\'s review.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_liability">All deadline calculations, appeal windows, and hearing dates shown in the app are estimates. The developer is not liable for any missed deadline or lost case resulting from reliance on automatic calculations or network outages. Always verify through official channels.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_verification">Golden rule: before taking any procedural action, verify every date against official sources and with the attorney responsible for the case.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_privacy_title">Privacy — we collect nothing</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_privacy_body">All case data is stored only on this device, inside a SQLCipher-encrypted database. The encryption key is generated on the device and wrapped by the Android Keystore — it never leaves your device. Cloud backup of the database is excluded. Cloud sync is optional and off by default.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_updates">The update checker sends a single read-only request to GitHub Releases. It sends no user data.</string>
